3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Tenmi-sensei! I have sent a request for the Fanart of my favorite character! My favorite character is Hong Kong's individual VTuber Kingyohime & Kingyohiri. [Request content] I would like an illustration of Kingyohiri singing on stage. Please leave the composition and pose design to the sensei. [Character supplementary information] She is the queen of the goldfish kingdom. [Possible uses] Smartphone wallpaper, YouTube thumbnails and eye-catching images in videos (including channel art and icons), Vtuber activities including each SNS activity (will not be used for merchandise) [Other requests] Please keep the image size at 16:9. It would be helpful if you could provide a PSD file with separate layers for the background, character and recipient's name. [Character reference] https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KpdNnKcQ-pKgUGirD8KWxz14HGNSkWLv?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_tennmy/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2616315, "client_id": 2994037, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=297f9e5f4c4c6e4748a55670e2d5853b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=297f9e5f4c4c6e4748a55670e2d5853b, https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae5e909a7ed3d2901a2e974271ccc4f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8802ada2f74c861e26ec89b1a1a22d3a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f476b2fdfc9a63982541b48f81690bf3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f476b2fdfc9a63982541b48f81690bf3, https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bc0a43614dcc921685975bd7293906c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f646e013/uploads/origins/547ed890-ac9b-40f2-addd-f823a3316c8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b51a7cb87a7f2313f20db757858bade 3x"}, "body": "Dear Tenmee.\n\nThank you for your help!\nI am Rate Hariyama 🦔✨️\n\nThank you so much for the wonderful illustrations when I sang \"Booo!\nI'd like to ask Tenmee-sama to draw it for me again!\n\nI'd like to ask you to draw it for me again!\nI would like to ask you to draw Rate Hariyama.\nI would like the composition to look like an idol singing energetically, but I can leave it to you.\nThe clothes can be either default or Tenmy-sama's original.\n\nCharacter Details\nA hedgehog girl who loves latte. She is originally an animal hedgehog, but can transform into human form. She is not a waitress at the café.\nShe is cheerful and calm, and likes to relax and sing songs while drinking café lattes and other drinks.\nHer hair has a whitish gradation toward the bottom, and she has outward curls that remind one of hedgehog needles, a calm face, and hedgehog ears. The lower part of her ribbon hair accessory is shaped like a spoon and fork.\n\n[Usage.\nI would like to use it for X, TikTok, YouTube thumbnails, videos, and distribution as a VTuber activity.\n\nRequests\nI would appreciate it if you could make the hair and arms as unbroken as possible.\nI would appreciate it if you could separate the background and characters into separate layers.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nHariyama\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-SQ3Rtt2gvJAUhgYxweRCccnCsQ5O4_b", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_tennmy/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2616315, "client_id": 1116837, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=434c423407ea2f64a7ec8f2bf23e66b4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=434c423407ea2f64a7ec8f2bf23e66b4, https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dbf8403fbe607e856a0045927a71a17 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c25584f11ee1c2827fc8702fe7e7a5d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d77306352a9ed860ce476f31911969be", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d77306352a9ed860ce476f31911969be, https://si.imgix.net/09d32636/uploads/origins/79710c80-4476-4d72-869d-4ccaca247d51?bg=%23f